## 💡 **8. Conversion Logic: Intermediate → Appian**

### **Mapping Rules**

| BAW Type                | Appian Equivalent  | Notes                      |
| ----------------------- | ------------------ | -------------------------- |
| HumanService / UserTask | User Input Task    | Becomes form node          |
| ServiceTask             | Script Task        | Executes logic             |
| Decision                | Gateway            | Conditional branching      |
| BO (Business Object)    | CDT                | Generates custom data type |
| Coach View              | SAIL Interface     | Appian UI                  |
| Integration Service     | Appian Integration | REST/Expression mapping    |

### **Conversion Steps**

1. **Generate CDT**

   ```python
   <complexType name="Customer">
     <element name="customerName" type="xsd:string"/>
     <element name="email" type="xsd:string"/>
   </complexType>
   ```

